I am in the market.
It is near my house.
It is morning time right now.
There is a lot of crowd in the market.
There is a lot of noise here.
There are many colours all around.
The shopkeepers are calling out loudly.
"Take fresh vegetables!" a vendor says.
"Take sweet fruits!" a voice comes from the other side.
There is a lot of hustle and bustle here.
There are cloth bags in my hands.
I also have my list with me.
I read my list.
I need bananas and tomatoes.
I need tea masala too.
Today I need a lot of items.
I go inside the market.
First of all, I look for a fruit shop.
